<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">Have spoken to Key person in Nissan Motor and found as follows.</sp=
an></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US"></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">1) Target date for RFQ distribition is NOV19 as an outcome from Ren=
ault's meeting</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">2) Nissan has larger volume on ASIA-EUR trade and It is almost sure=
 for Nissan&nbsp;to mainly control the trade on their tender,</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">however they still work on fixing role of Renault and Nissan by lan=
e.&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">Further details won't be available until RFQ is given.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">3) Indivisual negotiation has been ongoing. Nissan&nbsp;suggested t=
arget rate for 3 year contract to</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">7 carriers and now waiting for an outcome from each carrier.</span>=
</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D=
"EN-US">4) Target rate can not be disclosed to others than designated carri=
er.</span></p>
</div>
<p><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D"EN-US">5) Specific =
lanes included in&nbsp;open tender will vary by results of indivisual negot=
iation.</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D"EN-US"></span>&nbsp=
;</p>
<p><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D"EN-US">Though we ar=
e not listed in an indivisual negotiation carrier, submitted our wish list =
of lanes where we want to be involved in next 3 years.</span></p>
<p><span style=3D"FONT-FAMILY: 'Malgun Gothic'" lang=3D"EN-US">We will cont=
inue to seek through communication with Nissan for further details and any =
hints to&nbsp;form our strategy.</span></p>
